            "description": {
              "value": "Your studies of the undead have taught you telltale signs of a disguised undead creature. When you Pursue a Lead that involves a corpse or creature within your reach, you can touch that corpse or creature to immediately determine if it is undead. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Recall Knowledge checks about undead creatures and to determine if a creature is undead."
